.cargo
.claude
target

# Model run output
*-fit.yaml
*-sdtab.csv
*-timing.txt
*-conddist.csv
*-conddist-samples.csv
*-covtab.csv

# Rust compiler crash dumps
rustc-ice-*.txt
.claude/
.archive/

# Built documentation output — generated and deployed by CI (.github/workflows/docs.yml)
docs/_site/
bench_*.csv

# Externally provisioned data that may not be redistributed (#1913): written by
# tools/mbma_canakinumab_fetch.py, read by the test of the same name. Never commit.
# The name pattern also covers a copy next to nonmem_anchor/mbma_canakinumab.ctl,
# where `<name>.csv` beside `<name>.ctl` is otherwise the committed convention.
data/external/
mbma_canakinumab*.csv

# Python bytecode from the nonmem_anchor reference scripts
__pycache__/
